<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm Tom Mikota. I've spent twenty years building production pipelines for film and
      animation. Movie Manufacturing is where I write down how I think production should
      work: as a system that handles the technical chores so artists can spend their time
      on the craft.
    </p>
    <p>
      The ideas here run my own productions, including the Jack shorts, so the examples
      are real.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
